# Production origin used by metadata, canonical URLs, Open Graph, structured
# data, sitemap and robots.
# Set this on Vercel once the domain is live, e.g. https://your-domain.com
#
# Resolution order (src/data/site.ts):
#   1. NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL          — set this once a domain exists
#   2. VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL — provided automatically by Vercel
#   3. VERCEL_URL                    — the current deployment, from Vercel
#   4. http://localhost:3000         — local development only
#
# Build 08: a production build with none of the above omits absolute
# canonical and Open Graph URLs, the robots.txt Sitemap line and sitemap
# entries, instead of emitting http://localhost:3000.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
